# B-line axis program (`AxisU6`), part 9: `AxStepsAt` from the components

**`axSteps_at`**: the nine steps of axis `k` (slab 1, chunk, copy, gather, `J`, scatter, chunk,
swap, output) with total cost `8 Cs + 6 Cp + (9 + 6 C₀) Cc`, from the step lemmas of parts 7 and
8, the copy / swap of `J6SegAxCopy` (S2), the array lengths (`arr_lens`) and the value bounds
(`ValAt`).
