    (slSt u3 d3 bodyId) (kpSt eJ eJd ρ JK.dTJ dF eF eB eJK) (slSt u5 d5 bodyId)
    (kpSt eC eCd ρ KR.dT dF eF eB eK) (AxC.swapRS dA).code
    (slSt u7 d7 (passP drP rdP (itO pM) bkP))

end J6Seg.Ax

